---
import siteConfig from '../data/site-config';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import MothFleuron from '../components/marks/MothFleuron.astro';
import ContentsNav from '../components/ContentsNav.astro';
---

<BaseLayout description={siteConfig.description} showNav={false}>
    {/* Intro statement */}
    <p class="text-ink max-w-[600px] font-serif text-3xl leading-[1.12] font-light sm:text-[42px]">
        Software engineer, then nurse, now founder.
    </p>
    <p class="text-ink-soft mt-5 max-w-[520px] text-xl leading-[1.5] sm:text-[22px]">
    The throughline, as far as I can tell, is <span class="text-clay font-serif font-medium italic">following curiosity, bravely</span>.
    </p>

    {/* Body: prose + contents sidebar */}
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-8 sm:mt-12 sm:grid-cols-[1.6fr_1fr] sm:gap-10">
        <div class="text-ink space-y-4">
            <p class="drop-cap text-[19px] leading-[1.7]">
            I went from being a remote-working desk jockey to donning safety gear and spending years in hospital rooms and chemo suites. I left nursing to build software 
            for independent bookstores and personal libraries because I observed need at my neighborhood shops and in my own home.</p>

            <p class="text-[19px] leading-[1.7]">
            Working in oncology taught me that this life is too short, and big risks can offer big rewards. My version of a big swing is to
            follow my passion for books and reading and build software that helps the readers and the booksellers of the world.
            </p>

            <p class="text-[19px] leading-[1.7]">
            Everyone said working with bookstores was very niche, and they were right. It's a crowded space with small margins, and it does not scare me. Stop being a disrupter, 
            start serving the people.
            </p>
        </div>
        <ContentsNav />
    </div>

    {/* Lately */}
    <div class="mt-14 sm:mt-20">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <span class="small-caps shrink-0">lately</span>
            <div class="flex flex-1 items-center gap-2.5">
                <div class="border-rule h-px flex-1 border-b"></div>
                <span class="text-ink-faint inline-flex w-10 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
                    <MothFleuron class="w-full" />
                </span>
                <div class="border-rule h-px flex-1 border-b"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-ink-soft mt-4 max-w-[560px] font-serif text-[18px] leading-[1.65] italic">
            Antartica trip prep · book club reads competing with my TBR stacks · the bird-and-bee fountain · neverending solo dev tasks
        </p>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
